MODULE: QueueProgressDriveIgnoresParkedWaiter
TARGET: QueueProgress
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a non-queuing drive probe takes a released permit while a replay waiter is parked
PERTURBS: DriveAdmission

--- FIND
    /\ LET accepted == free > 0 /\ queue = <<>> /\ Cardinality(DriveHolders) < Max(1, Circulating \div 2)
--- REPLACE
    /\ LET accepted == free > 0 /\ Cardinality(DriveHolders) < Max(1, Circulating \div 2)
--- END